                    <div class="limitations">
                        <strong>Current Limitations:</strong>
                        <ul>
                            <li>High-frequency textures (hair, fur) require many coefficients</li>
                            <li>Sharp edges may cause ringing artifacts</li>
                            <li>Not optimal for images with significant noise</li>
                            <li>Computationally intensive for very high resolutions</li>
                            <li>Memory-intensive for many brightness levels</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <h3>Image Types</h3>
                    <p><strong>Well-suited:</strong> Landscapes, portraits, smooth gradients, illustrations</p>
                    <p><strong>Less suitable:</strong> Text documents, complex patterns, noise-heavy images</p>
